  "instruction": "Look at task-002_initial.scad. Set hole_diameter to 6 mm and edge_offset to 12 mm. Use difference() to subtract four vertical through holes from the mounting plate corners. The hole centers must be (+/-38 mm, +/-18 mm), and each hole must cut through the full 6 mm plate thickness. Fully render and export task-002_output.stl.",
